    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes surface underway data collected from R/V Laurence M. Gould in the South Pacific Ocean, South Atlantic Ocean, Southern Ocean, Drake Passage from 2017-12-31 to 2018-12-19. These data include barometric pressure, partial pressure of carbon dioxide (pCO2) - water, sea surface salinity, sea surface temperature and barometric pressure. The instruments used to collect these data include Carbon dioxide (CO2) gas analyzer and shower head chamber equilibrator for autonomous carbon dioxide (CO2) measurement.",
